  "question": {
    "text": "The volume of the greatest cone obtained by rotating a right-angled triangle of hypotenuse <math><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;units about a side is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;cubic units,&nbsp;then the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;equal to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "16",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/9f5d6978-e690-4d37-9799-f986be973f01.png\" style=\"width:1.95347in;height:1.37361in\" /><br />The volume generated <math><mo>=</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><msup><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>h</mi></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />For maximum volume, <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;<math><msub><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>16</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Also,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>",
